      "promptEs": "puntos y atributos de un RPG",
      "answerEn": "role-playing games represent abilities with numerical attributes that improve when points are added",
      "noteEn": "Strength and constitution are common character attributes. The joke treats real exercise as if it were a game system that awards visible stat points and levels.",
      "tags": ["gaming", "role-playing games", "joke context"]
    }
